---
args: {"source": "EvidencePage", "departures": "Handover[]"}
returns: "PromiseEpisode[]"
---
Distinguish tentative intention, explicit commitment, conditional commitment, authorized cancellation and a quoted historical promise. Link amendments only to the same evidenced promise identity. The person departing is not automatically the promisor of every forwarded thread. Keep source IDs, the exact beneficiary and deliverable, activation condition, unknown date and any conflicting reply. A conditional promise remains inactive until its actual triggering evidence exists.
